# Normalise line endings.
#
# Development happens on Windows and CI runs on Ubuntu. Without this, every file committed
# from Windows carries CRLF, and the diffs between a local run and a CI run become noise
# that hides real changes. `text=auto eol=lf` stores everything as LF in the repository
# while leaving working-directory endings to the platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary artifacts must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webm binary
*.zip binary
*.ico binary
